<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirm Your Email</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Google Sans', Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.30), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
        }
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            width: 125px;
            height: auto;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #202124;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 32px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }
        .button-container {
            margin: 32px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #1a73e8;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #70757a;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #dadce0;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://timemoz.com/logo.png" alt="Timemoz Logo" class="logo">
            
            <p>Work just got even better.</p>
            <br />
            <p>Thanks for joining Timemoz! Now that you’ve logged into the app, your projects, tasks, and team are all synced and ready to go.</p>
            <br />
            <p>Your login email: [{{email}}]</p>
            <br />
            <p>What’s next?</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Create your first project: Organize your work by game title, client, or department.</li>
                <li>Invite your team: Add your colleagues and assign them to specific projects.</li>
                <li>Start working: Use the lightweight desktop app to track time to your specific tasks.</li>
            </ol>
            <br />
            <p>Pro Tip for Management:</p>
            <p>When you invite a team member in the future, they will automatically see the projects you've assigned to them. No manual syncing or double entry is required—everything "just works" between the web dashboard and the desktop client.</p>
            <div class="button-container">
                <a href="{{url}}" class="button">Create Your First Project</a>
            </div>

            <br />
            <p>We’re excited to see what you and your team build next!</p>
            <br />
            <p>Best,</p>
            <p>{{founderName}}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">Jl. Mampang Prapatan Raya no 17c, Mampang Prapatan, Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia, 12790</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">&copy; 2026 Timemoz, Jakarta, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
